message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "NutEV Reference Engine: taxonomy-guided reference discovery and ranking for Lifestyle Nutrition"
abstract: >-
  NutEV Reference Engine is an open-source software tool for multi-source
  discovery, normalization, deduplication and prioritization of references in
  Lifestyle Nutrition research. It combines bibliographic and institutional
  sources with the NutEV keyword taxonomy and configurable focus terms to
  produce a ranked reading/reference queue. Ranking reflects
  information-retrieval priority and does not represent scientific
  inclusion/exclusion or a clinical recommendation.
